          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\"} | event_name=`user_prompt` | prompt_length < 20 [$__range])) / sum(count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\"} | event_name=`user_prompt` [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Share of prompts under 20 characters. These are nudges (continue, yes, ok) rather than instructions, so a high ratio means the agent stops or asks too often."
